# The citation of diff-ref-struct Web (Citation File Format 1.2.0). The version and the date are the release's
# (web/site/data/releases.yml); web/site/tools/release.py checks they agree.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use diff-ref-struct Web, please cite it with the version you used (shown at the foot of its start page)."
type: software
title: "diff-ref-struct Web"
abstract: "Series of powder diffraction patterns in the browser: overlays, stacks, projections, maps against temperature or time, difference maps and growth curves, computed by the diff-ref-struct core compiled to WebAssembly; the user's files are read in the browser and never uploaded."
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: Apache-2.0
